    <string name="longTextOrientationCapture">Capture the image of the top card on a flat surface and with good lighting.</string>
    <string name="longTextAnswerKeyIfAlter">You have an answer key registered. Do you want to keep or change the answer key?</string>
    <string name="longTextHelpQuickTest">Welcome to the Quick Exam main menu. \n Here, you can generate answer sheets and correct them easily and conveniently! \n\n
        • In the first option, you can generate an answer sheet by entering the number of questions and answer choices for your exam. Then, print as many copies as needed for your students.\n\n
        • In the second option, you can correct the answer sheet generated in the previous step by simply pointing the Kariti camera at it. The app will automatically correct it and display the result on your screen.\n\n
        • At the beginning of each correction session, you’ll be asked to fill in the answer key for your exam. Once completed, all answer sheets based on that key can be corrected in sequence.</string>
    <string name="longTextLimitQuestions">Kariti currently supports answer sheets with a maximum of %1$d questions!    </string>
    <string name="longTextLimitAlternatives">Kariti currently supports answer sheets with a maximum of %1$d options!</string>
    <string name="longTextDownloadNoNotify">Kariti will not be able to notify you about completed downloads!</string>
    <string name="longTextRequestPermission">To download the answer sheets to your device, you need to grant permission to Kariti!</string>
    <string name="longTextDownloadNotifyCard">The answer sheet has been generated and is available in your "device's" Downloads folder.\n\n
        You can print as many copies as needed from the sheet that was just created!
    </string>
    <string name="longTextGenerateCardError">An error occurred while trying to generate the answer sheet. If the issue persists: \n
        1 - Check if there is enough storage available for downloads.\n
        2 - Restart Kariti!
    </string>
    <string name="longTextGuidanceMarkedCards">The answer sheet must be filled out using a dark-colored pen, preferably black.</string>
    <string name="longTextHelpGenerateCards">In this section, you can generate answer sheets.\n\n
        • To generate an answer sheet, simply provide the number of questions and answer choices for your test.\n\n
        • Information such as the exam name, class name, teacher name, and date is optional.\n\n
        • Once you click on "Generate Card," Kariti will download the answer sheet to your "device's" Downloads folder.
    </string>
    <string name="longTextHelpSchool">• To continue using Kariti features, select the desired school. \n\n
        • Each school has its own information that is restricted from others. \n\n
        • To deactivate a school, simply select the desired school and confirm the action.\n\n
        Later, you can find your deactivated schools by clicking the Deactivated Schools button.
    </string>
    <string name="longTextBackupSendEmail">Your Kariti data has been sent to your email.\n\n
